  "description": "Ian Hope was once a normal gamer who downloaded the latest dark fantasy game, Aquilonia. The problem is he downloaded it illegally, which he believes is why he was transported into the game's world! Now, as his game character, he has to survive this cutthroat place full of corruption and betrayal. But that won't be easy since his character has already been ruined with skills that won't help him as the game progresses toward an apocalypse. Will he survive this dark fantasy? Or is all hope lost?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
